---
description: 
alwaysApply: true
---

Docs are source of truth: Docs/GameDesign.md + Docs/TechDesign.md.

No Unity types in GameCore.

Server authoritative: clients send intent, server validates, no client-side state authority.

Small diffs: don’t refactor unrelated stuff.

Ask before adding dependencies.

No “magic” singletons unless already existing.

Performance: no allocations in Update, no Find()/GetComponent() loops, pool objects.
